{
  "text": " I am actually watching people. I am watching people walking in the street ahead of me. And one of them has a light blue shirt and white sneakers, white trainers. And they are both kind of running actually, but I don't know if they are chasing each other. Or if they are just both running and one is not waiting for the other. Or maybe it's all relative. You know, one is running as fast as he can, although it looks like jogging. And then the other one is running as fast as he can. And they are both not very fast. I can't see them anymore. I wonder what they were doing. Because of this neighborhood, I have made judgments to make. I bet they did something naughty. Now they are running away from consequences. That's naughty. Maybe they were grown men. Or maybe they were running to save someone's life. Or maybe one of them's friends or girlfriends were pregnant and was ready to give birth. I can get to the hospital really fast because it's just around the corner. So I guess that's why they didn't run very fast. Because it's all relative. Thank you.",
